Subject: [PATCH] Playtendoh's Switch 2 side: crash and threads reports say
 more

Each report names the memory: the largest free block, the heap, the page tables, what the guest memory
service holds; a threads report is written when a write of the game's memory has waited 3 s for a block.

From these commits (oldest first):
- 2026-11-19 Playtendoh's Switch 2 side: a hang report when the game stops making frames
- 2026-11-19 Playtendoh's Switch 2 side: the graphics threads keep the last of the guest memory reserve
